RT @crypto_banter: 🚨LEDGER SPY IMPLANT FOUND IN EUROPE TOO!

@0xJohannes_ says a Ledger he bought in store from an official European reseller had extra cables inside. A clean device does not.

He says it looks like an older version of the spy implant.

@MagicalTux said the antenna is labeled as a Eurasian version, so more could be out there.

Reports now include Asia, South America, and Europe.

Always buy from the maker.
